-- 必修一 U1 语法三合一修复:清术语换新题 + 剥"选出"前缀 + 打散答案→A:15 B:15 C:15 D:15。
-- id 键 UPDATE,设固定值=幂等。Aaron service role 跑。共 60 条。
BEGIN;
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"We should respect ____."', option_a='very polite', option_b='quite often', option_c='afraid of failure', option_d='other people', correct_answer='D', explanation='respect 后接宾语需名词短语 other people;其余是形容词短语/副词短语,不能作宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='b154e992-0db7-4d8c-aa08-ca7c27483434';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"My adviser recommended ____."', option_a='advanced literature', option_b='very advanced', option_c='quite carefully', option_d='read widely', correct_answer='A', explanation='recommended 后接宾语用名词短语 advanced literature;very advanced 是形容词短语,quite carefully 是副词短语,read widely 是动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='fed8cb5f-eac1-4e2c-ac96-b35b14b576a0';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Every Wednesday we hand out food to ____."', option_a='homeless people', option_b='very poor', option_c='quite hungry', option_d='live nearby', correct_answer='A', explanation='介词 to 后接名词短语 homeless people;其余是形容词短语/动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='b549a95e-0c76-406f-bb78-10f148517367';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"On the first day I made ____."', option_a='very friendly', option_b='quite quickly', option_c='get along', option_d='some new friends', correct_answer='D', explanation='made 后接宾语用名词短语 some new friends;very friendly 是形容词短语,quite quickly 是副词短语,get along 是动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='bf5998cf-a50a-4d98-83e2-55361945ce99';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The school adviser helped me choose ____."', option_a='very suitable', option_b='quite easily', option_c='some suitable courses', option_d='easy to learn', correct_answer='C', explanation='choose 后接宾语用名词短语 some suitable courses;其余是形容词短语/副词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='d7f72aa1-6777-491e-8616-2503298b88bb';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"He told us ____ in class."', option_a='very funny', option_b='fun to hear', option_c='tell jokes', option_d='a funny story', correct_answer='D', explanation='told us 后接直接宾语用名词短语 a funny story;其余是形容词短语/动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='e48e9b7f-0cd5-40a1-bb17-0ccb2f904da9';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"I finally joined ____."', option_a='very active', option_b='a volunteer club', option_c='quite often', option_d='keen on sports', correct_answer='B', explanation='joined 后接宾语用名词短语 a volunteer club;其余是形容词短语/副词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='31e0760f-e6c3-4c7c-8f48-debddef8001d';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"I''m a bit worried about ____."', option_a='very busy', option_b='all the homework', option_c='quite hard', option_d='hard to finish', correct_answer='B', explanation='介词 about 后接名词短语 all the homework;其余是形容词短语,不能作介词宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='eeaecd55-fcc4-4374-850f-d71a6b6b40c3';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The coach gave me ____."', option_a='very useful', option_b='quite kindly', option_c='some good advice', option_d='help a lot', correct_answer='C', explanation='gave me 后接直接宾语用名词短语 some good advice;其余是形容词短语/副词短语/动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='d10f5927-7f6a-4ddd-9949-e6dbc1ba797a';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"I hope to be fluent in ____ one day."', option_a='very fluent', option_b='quite well', option_c='hard to learn', option_d='a foreign language', correct_answer='D', explanation='be fluent in 后接名词短语 a foreign language;其余是形容词短语/副词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='0cb0fce2-4ebf-42db-9f0b-e3d8a8270b73';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"____ is a big challenge for freshmen."', option_a='Quite hard', option_b='The first week', option_c='Very busy', option_d='Hard to manage', correct_answer='B', explanation='句首作主语用名词短语 The first week;其余是副词短语/形容词短语,不能作主语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='6aa3d646-dc41-4dc1-9725-074c28c74244';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Teenagers should take ____ for their own studies."', option_a='responsibility', option_b='responsible', option_c='responsibly', option_d='very seriously', correct_answer='A', explanation='take 后接宾语用名词 responsibility(名词短语);responsible 是形容词,responsibly/very seriously 是副词(短语)。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='8934be3b-4167-4360-8624-79adbb9cf0e5';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Most teenagers enjoy ____ after school."', option_a='joining different clubs', option_b='very active', option_c='quite often', option_d='good at sports', correct_answer='A', explanation='enjoy 后接名词性短语作宾语,joining different clubs 是名词短语;very active/good at sports 是形容词短语、quite often 是副词短语,都不能作宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='0d609ed9-0b38-433d-b6a1-62b33cfa6614';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"____ gave us a lot of help this term."', option_a='Very helpful', option_b='Quite quickly', option_c='The kind volunteers', option_d='Ready to help', correct_answer='C', explanation='句子缺主语,需名词短语 The kind volunteers;其余是形容词/副词短语,不能作主语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='ff8f8405-a865-4e60-88dd-f62169c50b08';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "The first week was a little confusing." 中,"The first week" 作____。', option_a='宾语', option_b='主语', option_c='表语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='B', explanation='The first week 是名词短语,位于句首作主语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='fb08bd1d-4ef0-42d8-a6dd-42351a4da874';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "I joined a volunteer club." 中,"a volunteer club" 作____。', option_a='主语', option_b='表语', option_c='宾语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='C', explanation='a volunteer club 是名词短语,作动词 joined 的宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='5f3b4707-6b1b-438c-8ae4-b5d17fbca5d7';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "Adam is a senior high school student." 中,"a senior high school student" 作____。', option_a='主语', option_b='宾语', option_c='状语', option_d='表语', correct_answer='D', explanation='该名词短语在系动词 is 后作表语,说明主语身份。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='318746da-780b-449f-bf04-89bd2ea79dbc';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"At school we can learn ____ from books."', option_a='useful knowledge', option_b='very widely', option_c='quite hard', option_d='good for us', correct_answer='A', explanation='learn 后接宾语需名词短语 useful knowledge;very widely 副词短语、quite hard 副词短语、good for us 形容词短语,均不能作宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='0fbae528-defa-4a90-8641-f5c2ab227cf9';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "He told us a funny story." 中,"a funny story" 作____。', option_a='主语', option_b='表语', option_c='直接宾语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='C', explanation='told sb sth 结构里,us 是间接宾语,a funny story 是直接宾语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='7a5a8004-53fb-4ff8-87bf-2f63291094bc';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "Chinese is a very difficult language." 中,"a very difficult language" 整体是____。', option_a='形容词短语', option_b='名词短语', option_c='副词短语', option_d='动词短语', correct_answer='B', explanation='整个短语中心词是名词 language,very difficult 只是其中的修饰语,故整体是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='ea335529-b0c7-44a3-b1a0-f32ec3af956c';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Many teenagers are ____ computer games."', option_a='addicted in', option_b='addicted with', option_c='addicted to', option_d='addicted at', correct_answer='C', explanation='be addicted to sth 是固定搭配,意为“对……上瘾”,介词只能用 to。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='742fec5e-b58d-49b7-a227-098268738adf';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The teacher is always ____ his students."', option_a='patient to', option_b='patient for', option_c='patient with', option_d='patient at', correct_answer='C', explanation='be patient with sb 表示“对某人有耐心”,介词用 with。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='34c438ad-b8ed-4341-86c1-bd2e62acff83';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"I''m really ____ English literature."', option_a='interested on', option_b='interested at', option_c='interested in', option_d='interested for', correct_answer='C', explanation='be interested in sth 表示“对……感兴趣”,介词用 in。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='1985b4c0-9415-41f8-b0c5-bf2999fd9bd8';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"After years of practice, she is ____ Chinese."', option_a='fluent in', option_b='fluent at', option_c='fluent on', option_d='fluent with', correct_answer='A', explanation='be fluent in a language 表示“某语言流利”,介词用 in。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='23e0d116-03c8-4181-8d6b-01e9dd9ac0bd';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"As the captain, you are ____ keeping the team together."', option_a='responsible of', option_b='responsible with', option_c='responsible at', option_d='responsible for', correct_answer='D', explanation='be responsible for sth 表示“对……负责”,介词用 for。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='123e1df2-e0dd-4c87-a02c-bca818040379';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Don''t be ____ making mistakes — everyone does."', option_a='afraid of', option_b='afraid to', option_c='afraid for', option_d='afraid at', correct_answer='A', explanation='be afraid of doing sth 表示“害怕做某事”;此处接动名词 making,用 of(afraid to 后须接动词原形)。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='3e0c21bb-2ffc-4377-bec3-7df2d5a9f37b';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Adam is quite ____ maths and science."', option_a='good in', option_b='good on', option_c='good for', option_d='good at', correct_answer='D', explanation='be good at sth 表示“擅长……”,介词用 at。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='d6d7962e-ce93-4e1d-8847-ca85b3475574';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Are you ____ joining the music club?"', option_a='keen at', option_b='keen on', option_c='keen in', option_d='keen for', correct_answer='B', explanation='be keen on (doing) sth 表示“热衷于……”,介词用 on。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='2062541a-75fc-4692-9d44-e9513cf1755c';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The coach is ____ his strong team."', option_a='proud for', option_b='proud of', option_c='proud at', option_d='proud in', correct_answer='B', explanation='be proud of sb/sth 表示“为……自豪”,介词用 of。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='3b72d4f2-a374-4680-a819-2ac79bdd95e5';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Many freshmen are ____ the new courses."', option_a='worried for', option_b='worried about', option_c='worried on', option_d='worried at', correct_answer='B', explanation='be worried about sth 表示“为……担心”,介词用 about。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='04e4deab-bf01-45c8-9d25-282b0775d18d';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Our monitor is always ____ help others."', option_a='ready to', option_b='ready for', option_c='ready of', option_d='ready at', correct_answer='A', explanation='be ready to do sth 表示“乐意/准备做某事”,后接动词原形 help,用 to。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='05b44c30-b742-472b-8c9f-34be329231fc';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"It is ____ to make a workable schedule."', option_a='important', option_b='importantly', option_c='importance', option_d='to import', correct_answer='A', explanation='"It is + 形容词 + to do" 结构,空处作表语用形容词 important;importantly 是副词,importance 是名词,to import 是动词不定式。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='38abd4b1-f712-4698-ac64-dfde96fb4d06';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Many freshmen feel ____ on the first day."', option_a='a new school', option_b='quite quickly', option_c='a little nervous', option_d='make friends', correct_answer='C', explanation='feel 是系动词,后接形容词短语作表语 a little nervous;a new school 名词短语、quite quickly 副词短语、make friends 动词短语,均不能作表语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='b4c925ff-2cb5-49c8-98fa-14a59dcd95dd';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Some teenagers are ____ computer games."', option_a='a waste of time', option_b='playing all day', option_c='addicted to', option_d='late at night', correct_answer='C', explanation='be addicted to 沉迷于,形容词短语作表语:be addicted to computer games;其余不能跟在 are 后再接 games。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='2175ab7d-4da9-4c07-a525-6dea088acfe5';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "The first week was a little confusing." 中,"a little confusing" 作____。', option_a='主语', option_b='宾语', option_c='定语', option_d='表语', correct_answer='D', explanation='形容词短语 a little confusing 在系动词 was 后作表语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='c56d7f96-2a36-4a77-ad3a-140295ada05e';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "I found the lesson very interesting." 中,"very interesting" 作____。', option_a='表语', option_b='主语', option_c='状语', option_d='宾语补足语', correct_answer='D', explanation='found + 宾语 the lesson + 形容词短语 very interesting 作宾语补足语,说明宾语状态。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='6d69a0c9-eb16-41ea-b2c5-95727853c1cc';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"As the monitor, you should be ____ the whole class."', option_a='a good leader', option_b='very carefully', option_c='help everyone', option_d='responsible for', correct_answer='D', explanation='be responsible for 对…负责,形容词短语作表语;a good leader 名词短语、very carefully 副词短语、help everyone 动词短语,不能接 the whole class 构成表语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='4dad6d6e-9e21-41e3-93a4-494ed3f1c408';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "The building is so big that I''m lost." 中,"so big" 作____。', option_a='主语', option_b='表语', option_c='宾语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='B', explanation='形容词短语 so big 在系动词 is 后作表语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='5f6ab85e-0ac4-46c2-a93c-a605b3c82995';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"She is ____ English literature."', option_a='very interested in', option_b='a big fan', option_c='reads a lot', option_d='quite often', correct_answer='A', explanation='be interested in 对…感兴趣,形容词短语作表语:be interested in English literature;a big fan 名词短语、reads a lot 动词短语、quite often 副词短语,均不合适。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='2c057a80-c056-4beb-b74b-17954fce39f4';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "The new coach made the team stronger." 中,"stronger" 作____。', option_a='表语', option_b='宾语补足语', option_c='主语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='B', explanation='made + 宾语 the team + 形容词 stronger 作宾语补足语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='fbc29fa2-0b1d-46f7-8914-830d215f3161';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"You''ll finish the homework ____."', option_a='very busy', option_b='a long time', option_c='pretty soon', option_d='hard work', correct_answer='C', explanation='修饰动词 finish 作状语用副词短语 pretty soon;very busy 是形容词短语,a long time / hard work 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='ece2e47d-aa48-42db-ae43-a59b30641c39';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"He answered the question ____."', option_a='very polite', option_b='a polite way', option_c='be polite', option_d='very politely', correct_answer='D', explanation='修饰动词 answered 用副词短语 very politely;very polite 是形容词短语,a polite way 是名词短语,be polite 是动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='41147316-1371-49d3-b814-781c84dbd06d';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Please read the new words ____."', option_a='aloud and clearly', option_b='loud and clear', option_c='a clear voice', option_d='very clear', correct_answer='A', explanation='修饰动词 read 用副词短语 aloud and clearly;loud and clear / very clear 是形容词短语,a clear voice 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='225a1849-bda6-4fd6-bc78-83530639d7b5';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The teacher spoke ____, so I couldn''t follow."', option_a='too quick', option_b='a fast speaker', option_c='too fast', option_d='very fast speech', correct_answer='C', explanation='修饰动词 spoke 用副词短语 too fast(fast 此处为副词);too quick 是形容词短语,后两项是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='87eb86a3-b19e-4ff1-b6c7-6b44cfe1da04';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Rita plays the violin ____."', option_a='quite good', option_b='quite well', option_c='a good player', option_d='very nice', correct_answer='B', explanation='修饰动词 plays 用副词短语 quite well;quite good / very nice 是形容词短语,a good player 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='f8242871-f5d8-4cb9-90cc-5afe4dea1be8';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"My French class went ____."', option_a='surprisingly good', option_b='surprisingly well', option_c='a good class', option_d='very nice', correct_answer='B', explanation='修饰动词 went 用副词短语 surprisingly well;surprisingly good / very nice 是形容词短语,a good class 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='a5f6602c-d3e5-41bb-872e-506b6da68b61';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"He runs ____ now than before."', option_a='very fast speed', option_b='much faster', option_c='a fast runner', option_d='quite quick', correct_answer='B', explanation='修饰动词 runs 且用于比较用副词短语 much faster;quite quick 是形容词短语,其余是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='5f6f5db4-3255-48fe-abce-8d7fb9b2245d';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"If you practise every day, you''ll improve ____."', option_a='quite quick', option_b='quite quickly', option_c='a quick way', option_d='very quick', correct_answer='B', explanation='修饰动词 improve 用副词短语 quite quickly;quite quick / very quick 是形容词短语,a quick way 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='142bc0d3-7659-4368-8f9d-995fb7313bf7';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"She speaks English ____."', option_a='very quick', option_b='a fast mind', option_c='very fast', option_d='quite clever', correct_answer='C', explanation='修饰动词 speaks 用副词短语 very fast(fast 作副词);very quick / quite clever 是形容词短语,a fast mind 是名词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='6bae564c-a4a6-4912-8c0e-695b8d6ace2d';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"I''ll improve ____ so I can make the team."', option_a='my own effort', option_b='very independent', option_c='on my own', option_d='work alone', correct_answer='C', explanation='on my own 等于副词 independently,修饰 improve 作方式状语;my own effort 是名词短语,very independent 是形容词短语,work alone 是动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='120e45fa-d9ac-4cd5-9300-7becccf55d6c';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"She finished the test ____ than me."', option_a='more quick', option_b='a quick test', option_c='very fast', option_d='more quickly', correct_answer='D', explanation='比较级状语修饰 finished 用副词短语 more quickly;more quick 形式错误,a quick test 是名词短语,very fast 无比较含义不搭 than。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='30c46a8b-7e08-4a99-bc95-f7300599e735';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The team members work ____."', option_a='very well together', option_b='very good', option_c='a good team', option_d='get along', correct_answer='A', explanation='修饰动词 work 用副词短语 very well together;very good 是形容词短语,a good team 是名词短语,get along 是动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='f1552c00-23c4-4239-83a5-759a2e072fc7';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"He finished the project ____."', option_a='a quick job', option_b='very quickly', option_c='very quick', option_d='quick to finish', correct_answer='B', explanation='修饰动词 finished 需副词短语 very quickly;a quick job 名词短语、very quick / quick to finish 形容词短语,都不能修饰动词。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='05c5155d-118d-4353-99fe-9c3c76aa0ed7';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"Please listen ____ in class."', option_a='very carefully', option_b='a careful student', option_c='careful enough', option_d='take notes', correct_answer='A', explanation='修饰动词 listen 需副词短语 very carefully;其余是名词/形容词/动词短语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='0201be16-cf07-4681-b8e3-ee14cbde3b3b';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "Linda thinks and speaks quite quickly." 中,"quite quickly" 作____。', option_a='状语', option_b='表语', option_c='宾语', option_d='定语', correct_answer='A', explanation='副词短语 quite quickly 修饰动词 thinks and speaks,作状语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='3edaada4-872f-472a-bccf-e40e13293ed1';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "I didn''t play well enough." 中,"well enough" 作____。', option_a='表语', option_b='宾语', option_c='主语', option_d='状语', correct_answer='D', explanation='副词短语 well enough 修饰动词 play,作状语。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='b8bb1013-b619-45a6-af86-44a80598fafe';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"We should manage our time ____."', option_a='a good plan', option_b='very busy', option_c='make a schedule', option_d='more wisely', correct_answer='D', explanation='修饰动词 manage 需副词短语 more wisely;a good plan/make a schedule 名词或动词短语、very busy 形容词短语,均不合适。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='7d6c5158-fae5-465c-83b1-a1d0a09e7e99';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='句子 "We worked together very well." 中,"very well" 修饰的是____。', option_a='名词 we', option_b='形容词 together', option_c='整个句子', option_d='动词 worked', correct_answer='D', explanation='副词短语 very well 作状语,修饰动词 worked,说明做事的方式。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='896b6b46-19be-41f4-adae-6c3871874020';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"The meeting started ____."', option_a='right on time', option_b='a great idea', option_c='very important', option_d='start early', correct_answer='A', explanation='修饰动词 started 表时间需副词短语 right on time;a great idea 名词短语、very important 形容词短语、start early 动词短语,均不能修饰 started。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='086682f4-25bf-45d0-9588-1688634fd837';
UPDATE public.junior_grammar_questions SET stem='"After years of practice, she speaks ____."', option_a='a fluent speaker', option_b='very fluent', option_c='quite fluently', option_d='learn fast', correct_answer='C', explanation='修饰动词 speaks 需副词短语 quite fluently;a fluent speaker 名词短语、very fluent 形容词短语、learn fast 动词短语,均不合适。', question_type='mcq' WHERE id='45131931-d69e-41ed-8433-14d2532f8135';
COMMIT;
-- 校验
SELECT correct_answer, count(*) FROM public.junior_grammar_questions WHERE point_id IN (SELECT id FROM public.junior_grammar_points WHERE volume='required1' AND unit='U1') GROUP BY correct_answer ORDER BY correct_answer;
SELECT count(*) AS prefixed FROM public.junior_grammar_questions WHERE point_id IN (SELECT id FROM public.junior_grammar_points WHERE volume='required1' AND unit='U1') AND stem ~ '^选出';
SELECT count(*) AS terminology FROM public.junior_grammar_questions WHERE point_id IN (SELECT id FROM public.junior_grammar_points WHERE volume='required1' AND unit='U1') AND stem ~ '下列哪一';
